# lite-makers: the Lite image anyone may flash (docs/install/README.md).
# lite-main's defaults with the parts that need the Hive's or our private
# keys taken out. tools/build.sh sees the 'makers' file in this folder and
# builds it with no Spotify key, Hive key, relay or update URL and unsigned,
# then tools/makers_check.py scans the images and refuses a leak.
# Spotify Connect needs our Spotify developer key built in; without it the
# speaker would show up in the Spotify app and play nothing, so it is off.
# CONFIG_CSPOT_SINK is not set
# CONFIG_HIFI_LAB is not set
